"<strong>Dashboards</strong> to monitor sponsorship revenue, ticket sales, "
"recruitment pipeline, and bookings."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Dashboards</strong> om sponsorinkomsten, ticketverkoop, "
"wervingspijplijn en boekingen te monitoren."

